# Each player has cast a Lightning Bolt (at the other's face), so both graveyards hold a card. Bot1 casts Rest in Peace on
# turn 3: its enters trigger exiles all graveyards at once, each card to its owner's exile (CR 406.2), leaving both
# graveyards empty. Rest in Peace itself goes nowhere: it enters the battlefield.

